## **Device Changelog** ##

**Raphael (07/02/2025)**
```bash
- Included Leica camera.
- inclueded anti-flicker.
- inclueded display mode.
- inclueded bcr (basic call recorder).
- leica: Disable parallel processing by default.
- leica: bring back universal setings and expert mode.
- make some adjustment related to boot animation resolution.
- Move persist.vendor.qti.telephony.vt_cam_interface to system_ext.prop.
- rootdir: Use stop instead of setprop for console.
- dontaudit vendor_thermal-engine capability dac_override.
- Drop sysfs_msm_subsys rules.
- sepolicy: allow vendor to write write to sched nodes.
- Moved some props to system_ext.
- resolved GNSS denial.
- kernel: make some changes related to governor.
- Fix an issue where the flashlight cannot be used immediately after a reboot.
- Overhaul UClamp & Powerhint setup.
- powerhint: Rework GPU freq boosting.
```
**Raphael (10/01/2025)**
```bash
- Initial Official Build 
```
